          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our mouth is open unto you, O Corinthians, our heart is enlarged. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye are not straitened in us, but ye are straitened in your own affections. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now for a recompense in like kind (I speak as unto ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " children), be ye also enlarged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not unequally yoked with unbelievers: for what fellowship have righteousness and iniquity? or what communion hath light with darkness? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what concord hath Christ with Belial? or what portion hath a believer with an unbeliever? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what agreement hath a temple of God with idols? for we are a temple of the living God; even as God said, I will dwell in them, and walk in them; and I will be their God, and they shall be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
